meta {
  name: list undelivered notifications
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?limit=50
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  limit: 50
}

docs {
  Claims across every guild. There is no guild filter and no actor header: the outbox
  has one reader, the bot process, and scoping it per guild would cost a request per
  guild per tick. Each row carries discord_guild_id so the bot knows where to deliver.

  Claiming is destructive in the sense that a claimed row is hidden from other pollers
  for the lease (5 minutes) or until it is acked.
}
